your forehead.

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:28.261
-Okay.
-Okay.

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:30.763
-Using your facial muscles,
get that cookie to the mouth.

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:32.731 line:0%
