Oh, it's stuck
in the beard.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:50.316
It's stuck
in the beard, oh.

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:52.252
Keep on going.

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:54.720
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.790
Keep on going.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.025
There you go.
There you go.

